+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386).
+Object members in a patch are merged recursively; a member with a `null` value is removed. Arrays and
+other values replace the target value. The target and patch are not mutated.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+applyMergePatch(
+  { service: { name: 'catalog', enabled: true } },
+  { service: { enabled: null, replicas: 2 } },
+); // { service: { name: 'catalog', replicas: 2 } }
+```
