+
+Implement RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch support.
+
+Export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` from `src/index.ts`. It must apply an object patch
+recursively, delete members whose patch value is `null`, replace arrays and scalar values, and leave
+both input JSON documents unmodified. Document the API and cover standard and edge-case behaviour.
